Today is Monday morning.
I am in the office.
Suresh is my manager.
He calls Rohan and me.
We go to him.
Suresh says, "Maya, welcome to the new core team."
I say, "Thank you, Suresh."
He says, "The client has given a major software project."
I am very excited about the new project.
Suresh says, "I have sent the client's requirements to the computer."
Rohan asks, "When do we start this work?"
Suresh says, "We begin the work today itself."
I open my laptop.
I read that document carefully.
Previously I have done a lot of work, but this project is entirely new.
I have already thought about the new code.
I say, "Suresh, you do not worry, I am ready."
He is very satisfied.
